.claude/rules/stack/*.md
!.claude/rules/stack/README.md
# Playwright is a harness-level default (the E2E tool the testing-doctrine picks),
# not a per-project generated stack rule — track it like README.md above.
!.claude/rules/stack/playwright.md
# Root-anchored: these are per-project throwaway/generated dirs at the repo root.
# Without the leading slash, a bare `prototype/` also matched `.claude/skills/prototype/`
# and silently dropped the prototype skill from the template.
/docs/
/prototype/
# Ephemeral TDD receipts — never commit (test-first gate reads these at runtime)
.claude/state/

# --- Jev (TypeSafe decision model) layer ---
# Live key lives here (settings.local.json), never committed; the .example is tracked.
.claude/settings.local.json
# Stray key drop from setup; the key belongs in settings.local.json only.
/secrets.md
# Jev per-call log (JEV_LOG target), if enabled.
.claude/jev.log
# Python bytecode cache from the Jev hooks.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# Playwright auth sessions used by the jev-browser-check skill — hold cookies.
.playwright/
# Upstream Jev resource pack download + its screenshot: vendored into .claude/ already.
/jev-use-cases/
/Screenshot*.png
